      "en": "You will know that I, the LORD, have heard all your insults which you have spoken against the mountains of Israel, saying, ‘They have been laid desolate. They have been given to us to devour.’",
      "ko": "네가 이스라엘 산들을 가리켜 말하기를 저 산들이 황무하였으니 우리에게 붙이워서 삼키게 되었다 하여 욕하는 모든 말을 나 여호와가 들은 줄을 네가 알리로다",
      "source_text_hash": "808e18b6dff96ba89e5c056a63a3cc7fed2e291ea0cab3fce900ec6d3b9b2caf",
      "translation_text_hash": "670e5da29056c7aef424016d826c1266978288be233ba85b6a5e1a1921703129",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
